The  driver  supports  the  Altima AC101, AC101L and AMD Am79c874
NetPHY‐1LP 10/100 Ethernet PHYs.  These PHYs are often  found  on
low‐power  Ethernet  interfaces, such as MiniPCI interfaces found
in laptops and embedded systems.  The AMD 79c874 is a  work‐alike
(most likely an OEM of the core) of the Altima part.
